## Testing layout

- Normalize every configured root as a target-relative path; reject absolute
  paths, traversal, empty values, and unresolved placeholders.
- Reject incompatible duplicate or ancestor-overlapping configured roots.
  Application-local migration specs may instead be colocated beneath an
  application source boundary without changing the configured migration root.
- Keep {{testing.unitSuffix}}, {{testing.integrationSuffix}}, and
  {{testing.e2eSuffix}} distinct so categories cannot resolve to the same name.
- Keep fixtures at {{testing.fixtureRoot}} and generated assets at
  {{testing.generatedAssetRoot}} outside application source roots.
- Validate only stack roots present in the composition. Frontend-only,
  backend-only, desktop, mobile, and full-stack selections remain valid without
  requiring an unrelated structure provider.
- Leave framework-owned test configuration and source ownership unchanged.
